<tr><th>Form</th><th>Name</th><th>Meaning</th></tr>
<tr><td>++x</td><td>pre-increment</td><td>increment, then use the new value</td></tr>
<tr><td>x++</td><td>post-increment</td><td>use the old value, then increment</td></tr>
<tr><td>--x</td><td>pre-decrement</td><td>decrement, then use</td></tr>
<tr><td>x--</td><td>post-decrement</td><td>use, then decrement</td></tr>
